WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Support yourself and bring keys within reach.
Choose the hand or input method that suits you.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Press a nearby key, then release.
There is no speed or ten-finger target.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Rest. Explore a keyguard or repeat-key settings.
An OT can help adapt your setup.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Example replay: a few keys at a time.
Do not force isolated finger movement.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Dictation and alternative input are valid options.
The practice tool does not change your device.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Final example: pause whenever you need.
Your hand may move differently.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.000
Keep the message, not a performance score.
Stop for pain, tightness or fatigue.
